134
00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.740
Parema käe reegel, Tõnis.

135
00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.040
Ja siis ma sain aru,
et sellepärast meil ongi If,

136
00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:14.640
Kasko kindlustus ka.

137
00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:18.480
If
siis noorematele inimestele publikus

138
00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:22.500
